.com/zh/articles/01a1b8ad-8362-7203-b2b9-3ffe90e0dbb4","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T01:02:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"ll1x88suhpv6hvr4xox6k6x8d"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Holograph前员工盗取10亿枚HLG代币被判5年有期徒刑","summary":"法国巴黎刑事法院判处Holograph前员工5年有期徒刑，因其在2024年5月至8月间非法创建并盗取10亿枚HLG代币（当时价值约1400万美元）。法院驳回了Holograph Foundation的赔偿请求，认为缺乏直接因果证据。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1b893-5cc2-725c-b9e2-e0068200443b","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T00:33:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"jxodcdnbz6j6vzznn2clu9drn"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"伯克希尔三季度净卖出股票并回购自家股份 现金储备升至3774亿美元","summary":"伯克希尔三季度净卖出股票并回购自家股份 现金储备升至3774亿美元，同时Alphabet仍为前五大重仓股。财报显示其前三季度净买入股票约111.99亿美元，但单季净卖出4.26亿美元，现金储备不降反升至3774亿美元。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202611073925556882.html","publishedAt":"2026-11-07T16:14:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba