ryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":"n4jexxhl9se4l6bue8uf7qb3s","title":"SignalPlus 用户安全事件赔付 81,897美元","summary":"SignalPlus 完成对23名受影响用户的 81,897美元全额赔付，并启动安全升级措施。事件源于第三方 Telegram 账户入侵，导致未设置 IP 白名单的账户受损。平台已暂停相关服务并实施以下防护：提升 API 访问权限（需企业级验证）、强制启用 IP 白名单、收紧员工设备管控。服务将在完成系统审查与升级后逐步恢复。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1b926-553f-7707-8cbb-de9d959a450f","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T03:14:19.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"followUp":"2026-11-06"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国中期选举加剧AI监管风险 中国自给自足主题获政策支持","summary":"美国中期选举引发AI监管担忧，巴克莱指出选举导致科技股抛售，但AI建设不会停，将更贵更慢；摩根士丹利认为中国自给自足主题获政策支持，与全球供应链公司形成分化。半导体板块受美国政策影响显著，欧洲因低敞口获相对优势，SpaceX因灵活定价能力或受益。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785473","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T06:00:34.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"s6l8bu741k4e36jxzwwt3n2j5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"下周中美CPI发布与Anthropic IPO路演及美债再融资关键日程","summary":"下周将发布中美10月CPI数据、俄美乌三方会谈结果及Anthropic IPO路演进展。韩国计划11月13日生效新政限制IPO后股价大跌，美债再融资规模达1250亿美元，超聚变等企业财报与超算大会同期举行。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785467","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T02:23:38.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"fv2e7s64qf2evi5iiz2i0lcpc"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国中期选举后各州暂停数据中心许可，SpaceX与Anthropic合同条款或致AI算力格局巨变","summary":"美国中期选举后，多州暂停发放新数据中心许可证，引发算力供应紧张。节目披露SpaceX与Anthropic的算力供应合同含90天退出条款，若触发或致AI产业格局重塑。超大规模云厂商或借机压制竞争对手，而依赖外部算力的公司面临成本激增风险，部分项目或被迫迁至海外。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785472","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T04:37:06.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"zh8idpldspgbofmnt0oqegvln"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"CoreWeave致信得州当选州长Hinojosa，寻求数据中心政策磋商","summary":"CoreWeave致信得州当选州长Hinojosa，寻求数据中心政策合作。Hinojosa已明确在立法完成前暂停相关审批，解冻最早需等到2027年5月立法会期结束。政策风险涉及13GW数据中心容量（可供电1000万户家庭），可能冲击全美AI资本开支约1.6%-4.1%。CoreWeave表态支持Hinojosa'原则立场，称愿与其过渡团队就已获批项目推进及未来开发标准展开合作。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785464","publishedAt":"2026-11-08T00:59:27.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"v0glnaskft6sb09g1kk8ucjns"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c68